  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rberedelsefas PROTAX II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation Phase PROTAX II - PROTAX 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget syftar till att st&#xf6;dja den albanska regeringen i f&#xf6;rberedelserna f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av fastighetsskattereformen. Syftet med Fastighetsskattereformen &#xe4;r att etablera samf&#xf6;rvaltning mellan kommuner och det centraliserade generaldirektoratet f&#xf6;r fastighetsskatt. Detta kommer att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den &#xf6;vergripande effektiviteten genom att utnyttja stordriftsf&#xf6;rdelar samt automatisering genom teknik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to support the Albanian Government in the preparation for the implementation of the Property Tax Reform. The aim of Property Tax Reform is to establish co-administration between municipalities and the centralized General Directorate of Property Tax. This will improve the overall efficiency by exploiting economies of scale as well as automation by technology.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  overall Objective and desired Outcome of the Inception Phase is that the Albanian Government has re-calibrated its approach to the Property Tax Reform and developed a realistic roadmap for its implementation, well-anchored among its main stakeholders. This roadmap constitutes a clear and predictable basis for continued development of institutional capacity supported by Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
